{
  "name": "[TRIGGER] VR Botão Sala",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "a1f0c0de-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Webhook Botão VR",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "7c1d2e3f-4a5b-4c6d-8e7f-90a1b2c3d4e5",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "vr-botao",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1f0c0de-0002-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Preparar Evento",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [240, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "f1", "name": "evento", "value": "={{ $json.body.evento }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "f2", "name": "botao", "value": "={{ $json.body.botao ?? 'principal' }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "f3", "name": "sala", "value": "={{ $json.body.sala }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "f4", "name": "usuario", "value": "={{ $json.body.usuario ?? 'anonimo' }}", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "f5", "name": "recebido_em", "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}", "type": "string" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1f0c0de-0003-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Responder para Sala VR",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [480, 0],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { ok: true, mensagem: 'n8n recebeu, ' + $json.usuario + '!', recebido_em: $json.recebido_em } }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a1f0c0de-0004-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Nota",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -260],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 620,
        "height": 220,
        "content": "## Botão da Sala VR\nRecebe POST do servidor da sala (`/api/acionar`).\n\n- **Auth:** Header Auth → nome `X-VR-Secret`, valor = `N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET` do `.env`\n- **Payload:** `evento, botao, sala, usuario, timestamp`\n- A mensagem em `mensagem` aparece no painel 3D da sala.\n- Plugue sua lógica (Supabase, WhatsApp, agente IA…) entre *Preparar Evento* e *Responder*."
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook Botão VR": { "main": [[{ "node": "Preparar Evento", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Preparar Evento": { "main": [[{ "node": "Responder para Sala VR", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" }
}
